{"v":1,"id":"b6ab0f32c928","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"Hear the word, O restless earth","s":21.48,"e":26.96},{"t":"You're sinking fast","s":28.2,"e":30.48},{"t":"Forgetting work","s":32.14,"e":33.66},{"t":"Hands of dust","s":35.58,"e":37.78},{"t":"Hearts of stone","s":38.86,"e":40.42},{"t":"You built a world","s":40.42,"e":44.28},{"t":"But lost your home","s":44.28,"e":47.7},{"t":"Lost at sea","s":52.44,"e":54.52},{"t":"In shifting sand","s":54.52,"e":57.62},{"t":"Trusting words","s":59.5,"e":61.14},{"t":"Of mortal hands","s":61.86,"e":64.54},{"t":"Knowledge high","s":66.0,"e":67.88},{"t":"Yet wisdom thin","s":68.82,"e":71.14},{"t":"Religion dressed","s":71.14,"e":74.68},{"t":"In robes of sin","s":75.34,"e":78.32},{"t":"The garden burns","s":78.32,"e":81.8},{"t":"By greedy flame","s":81.8,"e":84.68},{"t":"The fruit returns","s":85.8,"e":88.36},{"t":"It speaks your name","s":89.3,"e":92.2},{"t":"What you sow","s":92.2,"e":95.24},{"t":"Now circles back","s":95.84,"e":98.34},{"t":"Life grows weak","s":98.34,"e":102.12},{"t":"The way grows cracked","s":102.12,"e":105.68},{"t":"Darkness gathers","s":107.86,"e":110.18},{"t":"There's a wing and claw, yet no one trembles","s":110.18,"e":113.54},{"t":"No one draws near the truth that cries aloud","s":113.54,"e":117.96},{"t":"While wolves wear white and stalk the crowd","s":118.46,"e":122.22},{"t":"Tremble, heavens, earth, awake, the ground will move","s":125.62,"e":130.16},{"t":"The mountains shake by the knee","s":130.16,"e":133.46},{"t":"The hour has come, the king descends, the will be done","s":133.46,"e":138.58},{"t":"Tremble, nations, hear the sound","s":138.58,"e":142.14},{"t":"The lost are called, the proud brought down","s":142.14,"e":145.78},{"t":"Mercy stands, but time is thin","s":145.78,"e":148.98},{"t":"Choose the light or choose the end","s":148.98,"e":153.1},{"t":"Shepherds feed on flock and fame, building thrones in heaven's name.","s":168.74,"e":180.22},{"t":"They guard their halls, neglect the sheep, and trade the truth they swore to keep.","s":181.36,"e":193.9},{"t":"The houses fall, foundations crack","s":193.9,"e":200.5},{"t":"Dust and sorrow pile in stacks","s":202.24,"e":207.6},{"t":"Love was given, blood was paid","s":208.94,"e":214.08},{"t":"Yet still the call is pushed away","s":215.36,"e":220.98},{"t":"Still the voice of mercy cries","s":223.3,"e":227.14},{"t":"Before the storm splits open skies","s":227.14,"e":230.42},{"t":"Return, return, today is near","s":230.42,"e":233.88},{"t":"Salvation knocks, the door is here","s":233.88,"e":237.94},{"t":"Tremble, heavens, earth, awake","s":241.14,"e":243.96},{"t":"The ground will move, the mountains shake","s":244.52,"e":247.58},{"t":"Take, bow the knee, the hour has come","s":247.58,"e":251.04},{"t":"The king descends, the will be done","s":251.04,"e":254.34},{"t":"Tremble, nations, hear the sound","s":254.34,"e":257.8},{"t":"The lost are called, the plough brought down","s":257.8,"e":261.48},{"t":"Mercy stands, but time is thin","s":261.48,"e":264.72},{"t":"Choose the light or choose the end","s":264.72,"e":268.64},{"t":"Watch the fig tree","s":283.94,"e":286.22},{"t":"Leaves are green","s":286.22,"e":288.98},{"t":"The signs allow","s":290.36,"e":292.48},{"t":"The space between","s":293.1,"e":295.84},{"t":"What once was sealed","s":297.14,"e":299.88},{"t":"Is open and wide","s":300.72,"e":302.6},{"t":"What stood in shadow","s":304.02,"e":306.38},{"t":"Steps to life","s":307.82,"e":309.68},{"t":"A shout will tear the silent air","s":309.68,"e":316.32},{"t":"The faithful rise","s":317.14,"e":319.9},{"t":"The wicked fear","s":320.74,"e":323.04},{"t":"No metaphor, no empty word","s":323.6,"e":329.84},{"t":"Every line fulfilled","s":330.56,"e":333.26},{"t":"Fill every truth heard","s":333.26,"e":337.1},{"t":"Bow before the Holy One","s":339.28,"e":342.78},{"t":"The rock, the shield, salvation's sun","s":342.78,"e":346.22},{"t":"Lay your life upon the stone","s":346.22,"e":349.58},{"t":"Be lifted up or overthrown","s":349.58,"e":353.06},{"t":"Bow before the King who comes","s":353.06,"e":356.5},{"t":"The Alpha and the Living One","s":356.5,"e":359.76},{"t":"He does not change","s":359.76,"e":361.54},{"t":"His word stands true","s":361.54,"e":363.46},{"t":"The choice is now","s":363.46,"e":365.08},{"t":"It rests with you","s":365.08,"e":367.34},{"t":"Lay down your pride","s":381.6,"e":384.8},{"t":"Return me still","s":385.42,"e":388.12},{"t":"For heaven moves at the Father's will","s":388.12,"e":394.76},{"t":"The King is near","s":394.76,"e":398.18},{"t":"And mercy yet remains","s":401.36,"e":404.7}],"match":null}
